const page=document.createElement('main');page.id='mastersPage';page.className='masters-page';page.hidden=true;page.innerHTML='<nav class="masters-nav"><button type="button" class="masters-home">← 返回首页</button><span>妙棋手 · 象力大师赛</span><span class="masters-season">MASTERS / 16</span></nav><section class="masters-hero"><div class="masters-hero-copy"><div class="masters-kicker"><span></span> 妙棋手特别赛事</div><h1>象力大师赛<span>四轮，一席冠军。</span></h1><p>十六位棋手，一张签表。落子见高下，也让每一次相逢都有回响。</p><div class="masters-tags"><span>16 人单败淘汰</span><span>随机抽签</span><span>4 轮夺冠</span></div></div><div class="masters-hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="masters-orbit"></span><img src="./assets/fast-v1/grandpa-twohead-v3.webp" alt=""/><span class="masters-cup">'+cup+'</span><span class="masters-art-note">好棋，值得一场大赛。</span></div></section><section class="masters-status" aria-live="polite"></section><section class="masters-bracket-section" hidden><div class="masters-bracket-heading"><div><small>THE ROAD TO THE TITLE</small><h2>冠军之路</h2></div><span class="masters-progress"></span></div><div class="masters-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="赛事轮次"></div><div class="masters-bracket"></div></section><footer class="masters-rules"><strong>赛制说明</strong><p>你与 15 位电脑棋手同场参赛，四轮依次使用宗师的 2 倍、4 倍、8 倍、16 倍搜索预算。你的对局实际下棋，其他场次按棋手实力模拟赛果。胜者晋级；双方同意和棋后重赛。大师赛不可悔棋，退出可续赛。赛程保存在当前浏览器，登录账号之间分别保存。</p></footer>';
